# Object Colocalization Suite — Fiji menu entries.
#
# Both classes are in the default package, which is what ImageJ's own plugin
# discovery expects: it treats a class name containing an underscore as a
# plugin, and that convention predates packages. Everything with logic in it
# lives in ocs.* and is reachable from a script without going through these.
Plugins>Object Colocalization Suite, "Object Colocalization Suite", Object_Colocalization_Suite
Plugins>Object Colocalization Suite, "Batch (folder)", OCS_Batch
